# ==============================================================================
# Event Participant Project Mapping (Template)
# Format: PROJECT_ID, IAP_MEMBER, REGION, CITY
#
# Instructions:
#   Copy this file to `projects.txt` and fill in your actual event sandbox
#   details. `projects.txt` is git-ignored to prevent leaking participant
#   credentials.
#
#     cp projects.txt.example projects.txt
#
# Examples (keep these commented out; uncommented rows are parsed as real
# participants by deploy.py and the leaderboard dashboard):
#   my-hackathon-project-01, user:participant01@gcplab.me, europe-west3, Tokyo
#   my-hackathon-project-02, user:participant02@gcplab.me, europe-west3, London
#   my-hackathon-project-03, user:participant03@gcplab.me, europe-west3, Paris
# ==============================================================================
